# BizPilot AI · Part 1 — Database & Security
# Owner: Member 1 (see TEAM.md)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BizPilot AI — environment variables. Copy to .env.local and fill in.
# Never commit real values. Restart `npm run dev` after changing this file.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase project (Project Settings → API). The anon/publishable key is safe in
# the browser: every table is protected by Row Level Security.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key

# Public URL of the app (used for auth email redirects).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# AI assistant (optional). Server-side only — never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# Set ONE provider key. Gemini is used when GEMINI_API_KEY is set; otherwise
# Anthropic when ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set. Without any key the assistant still
# answers common questions with BizPilot's built-in calculator.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides:
# AI_PROVIDER=gemini            # gemini | anthropic (when both keys are set)
# AI_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash     # default: gemini-3.8-flash / claude-sonnet-5-5

# NOTE: the app does NOT need a Supabase service-role key. Do not add one.
